{"study_accession":"PRJNA1390242","secondary_study_accession":"SRP656089","title":"Transcriptional profile of Influenza H3-specific memory B cells following LAIV vaccination [LAIV.bulkRNAseq]","description":"Live attenuated influenza vaccination (LAIV) is the only FDA approved mucosal vaccine. Here, we determined the transcriptional profile of circulating memory B cell subsets that arise 14 days after LAIV vaccination. We used the expression of FcRL5 as a surrogate marker of Tbet+ memory B cells to compare the differences between these memory subsets. Influenza HA-B-cell tetramers were used to isolate vaccine-specific circulating cells for RNA-seq. These data highlight the differences and similarities between memory B cell subsets that arise following mucosla and intramuscular vaccination.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":6,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN54174972","study_accession":"PRJNA1390242","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"p30d14Fcr5posH3pos","description":"p30d14Fcr5posH3pos","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM9384856","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2026-08-27","attributes":[["source_name","PBMC"],["tissue","PBMC"],["cell_type","Memory B cell"],["sorting markers","CD19+IgD-CD38-H3Tet+FcRL5+"],["replicate","3"],["geo_loc_name","missing"],["collection_date","missing"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR36489248","experiment_accession":"SRX31510736","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":31068571,"base_count":4631247312,"first_public":"2026-08-27","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM9384856: p30d14Fcr5posH3pos Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN54174973","study_accession":"PRJNA1390242","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"p30d14Fcr5negH3pos","description":"p30d14Fcr5negH3pos","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM9384855","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2026-08-27","attributes":[[